# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Gawas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), bag-ong-linya.
Gawas isulat: ([''] tccompare: ['']), bag-ong-linya.
